#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups-filters.xml:30
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>CUPS Filters</application> package is only needed to adapt "
"<xref linkend=\"libcupsfilters\"/> and <xref linkend=\"libppd\"/> filter "
"functions for cups-2.x. It should not be needed for cups-3.x."
